{"path":"about.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang='en'>
<head>
  <meta charset='utf-8'>
  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>
  <title>About — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--accent:#7b5cff;--muted:#6b7280;--bg:#f7f6fb;--card:#ffffff;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.7)}
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;color:#111}
    body{background-color:var(--bg);background-image:url('assets/img/pattern.svg');background-repeat:repeat;padding:28px}
    .nav{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:22px}
    .nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px}
    .nav a.active{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(123,92,255,0.12),transparent);color:var(--accent);font-weight:600}
    .container{max-width:920px;margin:0 auto}
    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:18px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.85),rgba(255,255,255,0.95));padding:28px;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(17,17,17,0.06)}
    .eyebrow{color:var(--accent);font-weight:700;font-size:13px}
    h1{margin:6px 0 0;font-size:28px}
    p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}
    .two-col{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:20px;margin-top:18px}
    .bio{background:var(--card);padding:18px;border-radius:10px}
    .profile{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(123,92,255,0.07),rgba(123,92,255,0.02));padding:18px;border-radius:10px}
    .muted-small{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    .pill{display:inline-block;background:rgba(123,92,255,0.08);color:var(--accent);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:600;margin-top:8px}
    .accordion{margin-top:14px}
    .acc-item{background:var(--card);border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:10px;overflow:hidden}
    .acc-trigger{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:14px;cursor:pointer}
    .acc-content{padding:0 14px 14px;color:var(--muted);max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height 320ms ease}
    .acc-item.open .acc-content{max-height:420px}
    footer{margin-top:18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    .cta{display:inline-block;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}
    @media (max-width:880px){.two-col{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.nav{gap:10px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class='container'>
    <nav class='nav'>
      <a href='about.html' class='active'>Who I Am</a>
      <a href='approach.html'>How I Work</a>
      <a href='specialties.html'>Areas</a>
      <a href='book.html'>Book</a>
      <a href='faq.html'>FAQ</a>
      <a href='contact.html'>Contact</a>
      <a href='index.html'>Home</a>
      <a href='fees.html'>Fees</a>
    </nav>

    <section class='hero'>
      <div class='eyebrow'>Clinical care, with a human voice</div>
      <h1>Hi — I'm with you for the next honest step.</h1>
      <p class='lead'>I offer focused cohort cycles and individual sessions that respect your rhythm, values, and limits. My style is curious, gently direct, and aimed at helping you notice what matters most now.</p>
      <div style='margin-top:12px'>
        <a class='cta' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}' id='primaryCta'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class='two-col' style='margin-top:20px'>
      <div>
        <div class='bio'>
          <h3>About the clinician</h3>
          <p class='muted-small'>I’m a licensed clinician working with adults navigating career changes, relationships, life transitions, and chronic stress. Training includes integrative psychotherapy approaches and cohort-based clinical work. My aim is to help you find clearer options in everyday life — no quick fixes, just steady practice.</p>

          <h4 style='margin-top:12px'>Practice at a glance</h4>
          <ul class='muted-small' style='padding-left:18px;margin-top:6px'>
            <li>Individual short-term and open-ended therapy</li>
            <li>Small cohorts that meet over 6–8 weeks</li>
            <li>Video and in-person offerings where available</li>
          </ul>

          <div style='margin-top:12px'>
            <span class='pill'>Cohort model • supportive learning</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class='accordion' id='confAccordion'>
          <div class='acc-item' id='acc1'>
            <div class='acc-trigger' data-target='acc1'>
              <div>
                <strong>Boundaries & confidentiality</strong>
                <div class='muted-small'>What I keep private and what I must report</div>
              </div>
              <div style='color:var(--muted)'>▾</div>
            </div>
            <div class='acc-content'>
              <p>I keep session content confidential within the limits of law and ethical practice. Exceptions include situations that indicate imminent risk to you or others, suspected abuse of a vulnerable person, or court-ordered disclosures.</p>
              <p class='muted-small'>I will always aim to explain the steps I take if a safety or legal concern arises. If coordination with another professional is helpful (e.g., for medication or medical needs), we will discuss how to consent to that sharing.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class='acc-item' id='acc2'>
            <div class='acc-trigger' data-target='acc2'>
              <div>
                <strong>Session structure & cancellations</strong>
                <div class='muted-small'>What to expect each visit</div>
              </div>
              <div style='color:var(--muted)'>▾</div>
            </div>
            <div class='acc-content'>
              <p>Sessions typically run 45–55 minutes. We’ll check in, focus on an agreed area, and leave with one or two practical steps to try. If you need to cancel, please give 48 hours notice when possible; missed appointments and late cancellations may incur a fee.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <footer>
          <div style='font-weight:700;margin-bottom:6px'>If you are in immediate danger</div>
          <div class='muted-small'>Call 911 or your local emergency number. If you are in the United States and experiencing a suicidal crisis, you can dial or text 988 to reach the Suicide & Crisis Lifeline. If you are outside the U.S., contact local emergency services or a crisis resource in your area.</div>
        </footer>
      </div>

      <aside class='profile'>
        <h3 style='margin-top:0'>Practical details</h3>
        <p class='muted-small'><strong>Location:</strong> {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</p>
        <p class='muted-small'><strong>Contact:</strong> <a href='tel:{{PHONE}}'>{{PHONE}}</a> • <a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}'>{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
        <div style='margin-top:8px'>
          <div style='font-weight:700'>Programs</div>
          <div class='muted-small' style='margin-top:6px'>Cohort cycles (6–8 weeks) • Focused intensives • Ongoing individual care</div>
        </div>

        <div style='margin-top:12px'>
          <div style='font-weight:700'>Insurance & payment</div>
          <div class='muted-small' style='margin-top:6px'>Private-pay; I can provide superbills for out-of-network reimbursement. Sliding scale spots are occasionally available; please ask.</div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Accordion behavior
    document.querySelectorAll('.acc-trigger').forEach(function(trigger){
      trigger.addEventListener('click',function(){
        var id = this.getAttribute('data-target');
        var item = document.getElementById(id);
        item.classList.toggle('open');
      });
    });

    // Small enhancement: mark the primary CTA (works if loaded elsewhere)
    var cta = document.getElementById('primaryCta');
    if(cta){
      cta.addEventListener('click',function(){
        // no-op placeholder for analytics
      });
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"specialties.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang='en'>
<head>
  <meta charset='utf-8'>
  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>
  <title>Areas of Focus — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--accent:#ff6b6b;--muted:#50545b;--bg:#fffdfb}
    html,body{margin:0;height:100%;font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial;color:#111;background:var(--bg);padding:24px}
    .container{max-width:980px;margin:0 auto}
    .topbar{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:18px}
    .nav{display:flex;gap:12px}
    .nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px;border-radius:8px}
    .nav a.active{color:var(--accent);font-weight:700}
    h1{margin:0;font-size:28px}
    p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}

    .selector{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:16px}
    .mood{padding:10px 12px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #eee;cursor:pointer;color:var(--muted);transition:all 220ms}
    .mood.active{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,107,107,0.12),transparent);color:var(--accent);transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(255,107,107,0.06)}

    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:18px;margin-top:18px}
    .cards{display:grid;gap:12px}
    .card{background:#fff;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #f0f0f0}
    .method{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,rgba(255,255,255,0.8));padding:16px;border-radius:12px;transition:all 420ms}
    .method .title{font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:6px}
    .mood-note{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
    .cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}

    @media (max-width:860px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.topbar{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class='container'>
    <div class='topbar'>
      <div>
        <nav class='nav'>
          <a href='index.html'>Home</a>
          <a href='specialties.html' class='active'>Focus Areas</a>
          <a href='about.html'>About</a>
          <a href='approach.html'>Approach</a>
        </nav>
        <h1>What people often bring</h1>
        <p class='lead'>Short descriptions and thoughtful next steps. Pick what feels closest to you and see a recommended method below.</p>
      </div>
      <div style='text-align:right'>
        <div class='muted-small' style='color:var(--muted)'>Contact: <a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}'>{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class='selector' role='list' aria-label='Mood selector' id='moodList'>
      <button class='mood' data-key='overwhelmed'>Overwhelmed</button>
      <button class='mood' data-key='stuck'>Stuck</button>
      <button class='mood' data-key='anxious'>Anxious</button>
      <button class='mood' data-key='grieving'>Grieving</button>
      <button class='mood' data-key='transition'>In Transition</button>
      <button class='mood' data-key='burnout'>Burned out</button>
    </div>

    <div class='grid'>
      <div>
        <div class='cards'>

          <div class='card'>
            <h3 style='margin-top:0'>Short-term work</h3>
            <div class='mood-note'>Focused bundles to address a clear complication — 6 sessions or a 3-session mini-plan for practical shifts.</div>
          </div>

          <div class='card'>
            <h3 style='margin-top:0'>Cohort cycles</h3>
            <div class='mood-note'>Small groups across 6–8 weeks for shared learning, peer practice, and clinician guidance. Best for relational patterns and life transitions.</div>
          </div>

          <div class='card'>
            <h3 style='margin-top:0'>Ongoing care</h3>
            <div class='mood-note'>Open-ended therapy for deeper personality-level work, consistent support, and chronic stress management.</div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <aside>
        <div class='method' id='methodCard'>
          <div class='title' id='methodTitle'>Choose how you feel</div>
          <div id='methodDesc' style='color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px'>Select a state above and I'll suggest a practical starting point — plus a tailored next step.</div>
          <a id='moodCta' class='cta' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
        </div>

        <div style='margin-top:12px;padding:12px;background:#fff;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #f1f1f1'>
          <div style='font-weight:700'>Need a different pace?</div>
          <div style='color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px'>I offer single-session consultations and cohort starts throughout the year. If you aren't sure, choose "Let's talk" as a mood and we can clarify together.</div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Mood-to-Method mapping
    var map = {
      'overwhelmed':{
        title:'Micro-structure plan',
        desc:'Short-cycle work (4–6 sessions) to make small environmental and scheduling shifts that reduce daily churn. Practical experiments between meetings.',
        ctaText:'Request a short plan',
        ctaUrl:'{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?mood=overwhelmed'
      },
      'stuck':{
        title:'One-topic intensive',
        desc:'A focused 3-session intensive to create momentum on one stuck area — decision, conversation, or boundary. Includes brief pre-session planning.',
        ctaText:'Book a 3-session intensive',
        ctaUrl:'{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?mood=stuck'
      },
      'anxious':{
        title:'Practical calm toolkit',
        desc:'A blend of skills, short exposures, and values work across 6 sessions to reduce moment-to-moment anxiety and build tolerable routines.',
        ctaText:'Start a calm toolkit series',
        ctaUrl:'{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?mood=anxious'
      },
      'grieving':{
        title:'Companion cohort',
        desc:'A small cohort (6–8 weeks) focused on loss and adjustment. Shared stories, small practices, and clinician-led check-ins to help with meaning and daily function.',
        ctaText:'Join the next cohort',
        ctaUrl:'{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?mood=grieving'
      },
      'transition':{
        title:'Decision-focused sessions',
        desc:'Work across 4–8 sessions to weigh options, test assumptions, and support transitional moves with concrete planning tools.',
        ctaText:'Book a transition consult',
        ctaUrl:'{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?mood=transition'
      },
      'burnout':{
        title:'Capacity reset',
        desc:'A paced plan mixing boundary practice, values clarification, and small behavior changes to restore manageable energy levels.',
        ctaText:'Begin a capacity reset',
        ctaUrl:'{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?mood=burnout'
      }
    };

    var moods = document.querySelectorAll('.mood');
    var titleEl = document.getElementById('methodTitle');
    var descEl = document.getElementById('methodDesc');
    var ctaEl = document.getElementById('moodCta');

    function clearActive(){
      moods.forEach(function(b){b.classList.remove('active')});
    }

    moods.forEach(function(btn){
      btn.addEventListener('click',function(){
        var key = this.getAttribute('data-key');
        clearActive();
        this.classList.add('active');
        var item = map[key];
        // Visual morph: update title, desc, cta
        titleEl.textContent = item.title;
        descEl.textContent = item.desc;
        ctaEl.textContent = item.ctaText;
        ctaEl.setAttribute('href', item.ctaUrl);
        // small animation
        var card = document.getElementById('methodCard');
        card.style.transform = 'scale(0.998)';
        setTimeout(function(){card.style.transform='scale(1)';},220);
      });
    });

    // Accessibility: choose default if param provided
    (function(){
      var qs = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);
      var mood = qs.get('mood');
      if(mood && document.querySelector(".mood[data-key='"+mood+"']")){
        document.querySelector(".mood[data-key='"+mood+"']").click();
      }
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"approach.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang='en'>
<head>
  <meta charset='utf-8'>
  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>
  <title>Approach — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--ink:#0f1724;--accent:#0ea5a4;--soft:#f6fffe}
    html,body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial;color:var(--ink);background:#fbfdfd;padding:24px}
    .container{max-width:980px;margin:0 auto}
    .nav{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-bottom:18px}
    .nav a{color:#6b7280;text-decoration:none;padding:8px;border-radius:8px}
    .nav a.active{color:var(--accent);font-weight:700}
    h1{margin:0;font-size:28px}
    .pillars{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:18px}
    .pillar{background:linear-gradient(180deg,white,var(--soft));padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #eef6f6;flex:1}
    .notes{margin-top:18px;background:#fff;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #f3f6f6}
    .accordion{margin-top:12px}
    .acc-item{margin-bottom:8px;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden}
    .acc-trigger{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(14,165,164,0.06),transparent);cursor:pointer}
    .acc-content{padding:0 12px 12px;color:#475569;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height 300ms ease}
    .acc-item.open .acc-content{max-height:360px}
    .cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}

    @media (max-width:800px){.pillars{flex-direction:column}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class='container'>
    <nav class='nav'>
      <a href='index.html'>Home</a>
      <a href='approach.html' class='active'>Rhythm & Method</a>
      <a href='specialties.html'>Focus</a>
      <a href='book.html'>Reserve</a>
    </nav>

    <header>
      <h1>How I work — practical, relational, slow-cook change</h1>
      <p style='color:#6b7280;margin-top:8px'>My offerings combine direct therapeutic skills with group learning rhythms. Below are the guiding pillars and what to expect from a typical cycle.</p>
    </header>

    <section class='pillars'>
      <div class='pillar'>
        <strong>1. Small experiments</strong>
        <div style='color:#475569;margin-top:6px'>We test one change at a time — short exercises between sessions so ideas land in your real life, not just in conversation.</div>
      </div>
      <div class='pillar'>
        <strong>2. Structure + flexibility</strong>
        <div style='color:#475569;margin-top:6px'>Each cohort or short plan has a predictable arc, but content bends to what the group or you actually need.</div>
      </div>
      <div class='pillar'>
        <strong>3. Practice with peers</strong>
        <div style='color:#475569;margin-top:6px'>Groups allow for role practice and perspective shifts; not therapy theater, but purposeful, supported rehearsal.</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class='notes'>
      <h3 style='margin-top:0'>What a cycle looks like</h3>
      <ol style='color:#475569'>
        <li>Initial intake and orientation — 30–50 minutes to set aims.</li>
        <li>Core meetings — weekly or biweekly sessions with clear goals.</li>
        <li>Between-session experiments and short check-ins.</li>
        <li>A concluding review and next-step planning.</li>
      </ol>
      <a class='cta' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
    </div>

    <div style='margin-top:18px'>
      <h3 style='margin-bottom:8px'>Boundaries, confidentiality & scope</h3>
      <div class='accordion'>
        <div class='acc-item' id='b1'>
          <div class='acc-trigger' data-target='b1'>
            <div><strong>Privacy limits</strong><div style='color:#6b7280;font-size:13px'>What I keep private</div></div>
            <div style='color:#6b7280'>▾</div>
          </div>
          <div class='acc-content'>
            <p>Conversations are confidential except when disclosure is required by law (imminent risk of harm, suspected abuse, or court order). I will be transparent about any steps I need to take if such issues arise.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class='acc-item' id='b2'>
          <div class='acc-trigger' data-target='b2'>
            <div><strong>Scope of practice</strong><div style='color:#6b7280;font-size:13px'>Where I can help and where we may refer</div></div>
            <div style='color:#6b7280'>▾</div>
          </div>
          <div class='acc-content'>
            <p>I provide psychotherapy and facilitation for adults. I do not prescribe medication. If your care would benefit from psychiatric or medical evaluation, I will support referral and collaboration as needed.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style='margin-top:12px;color:#111;font-weight:700'>If you are in immediate danger</div>
      <div style='color:#6b7280;margin-top:6px'>Call 911 or local emergency services. If you are in the United States and are experiencing a suicidal crisis, call or text 988 to reach the Suicide & Crisis Lifeline. For other urgent needs, contact local emergency resources.</div>
    </div>

    <script>
      // accordion
      document.querySelectorAll('.acc-trigger').forEach(function(t){
        t.addEventListener('click',function(){
          var id = this.getAttribute('data-target');
          var el = document.getElementById(id);
          el.classList.toggle('open');
        });
      });

      // subtle accessibility enhancement: announce when accordion opens (aria-live could be used more fully)
    </script>
  </div>
</body>
</html>"} 
